{# Brand statement shown between the two product carousels. #}
<section class="section-yamuna-information" data-store="home-yamuna-information">
  <div class="yamuna-information-stage">
    <div class="yamuna-information-images yamuna-information-images-top" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-top-left" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-top-1.webp' | static_url }}" alt="">
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-top-center" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-top-2.webp' | static_url }}" alt="">
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-top-right" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-top-3.webp' | static_url }}" alt="">
    </div>

    <div class="yamuna-information-marquee" aria-label="Artesanal, natural, sustentável, orgânico e ayurveda">
      <div class="yamuna-information-marquee-track">
        <span>Artesanal</span><i>•</i><span>Natural</span><i>•</i><span>Sustentável</span><i>•</i><span>Orgânico</span><i>•</i><span>Ayurveda</span><i>•</i>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Artesanal</span><i aria-hidden="true">•</i><span aria-hidden="true">Natural</span><i aria-hidden="true">•</i><span aria-hidden="true">Sustentável</span><i aria-hidden="true">•</i><span aria-hidden="true">Orgânico</span><i aria-hidden="true">•</i><span aria-hidden="true">Ayurveda</span><i aria-hidden="true">•</i>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="yamuna-information-content">
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-bottom-left" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-bottom-1.webp' | static_url }}" alt="Produtos Yamuna">
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-bottom-center" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-bottom-2.webp' | static_url }}" alt="Produtos Yamuna">
      <div class="yamuna-information-copy">
        <p>Criamos alimentos que dão brilho nos olhos, que nutrem o que há de melhor em nosso ser. Alimentos para inspirar saúde e iluminar a vida.</p>
        <span>Daiane Bortolon</span>
        <a class="yamuna-information-button" href="{{ '/busca?busca=' | setting_url }}">Nossos produtos</a>
      </div>
      <img class="yamuna-information-image info-image-bottom-right" src="{{ 'images/yamuna/information-slider/slider-1-bottom-3.webp' | static_url }}" alt="Produtos Yamuna">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
